name chess-openings
match a.tsv b.tsv c.tsv d.tsv e.tsv
tier opening by \n
header
tier field by \t
part pgn grammar pgn_moves
content eco name source move commentary annotation
# The ordered SAN sequence is the opening's content. ECO is a classification,
# not an identity or a game result. No win/loss evidence is invented.
thing moves of move
thing opening pgn/moves
relation "opening name" name
relation "Encyclopaedia of Chess Openings code" eco
attest opening name eco
